span class=\"fn\">β</span>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">op</span> <span class=\"fn\">r</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">Q'</span> <span class=\"fn\">a</span>)</span></span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">E</span>)</span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hpre</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Internal/Order/Basic.html#Lean.Order.PartialOrder.rel\">PartialOrder.rel</a> <span class=\"fn\">pre</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">t</span>.<a href=\"./Std/Internal/Order/PredTrans.html#Lean.Order.PredTrans.apply\">apply</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">Q</span> <span class=\"fn\">E</span>)</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Internal/Order/Basic.html#Lean.Order.PartialOrder.rel\">PartialOrder.rel</a> <span class=\"fn\">pre</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Std/Internal/Order/FrameClosure.html#Lean.Order.PredTrans.frameClosure\">frameClosure</a> <span class=\"fn\">op</span> <span class=\"fn\">t</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Std/Internal/Order/PredTrans.html#Lean.Order.PredTrans.apply\">apply</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">Q</span> <span class=\"fn\">E</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Landing below the frame closure reduces to landing below the base transformer together with\nframing: if `pre ⊑ t.apply Q E` and `t` frames every `op r`, then\n`pre ⊑ (t.frameClosure op).apply Q E`. ","docLink":"./Std/Internal/Order/FrameClosure.html#Lean.Order.PredTrans.le_frameClosure","kind":"theorem","line":95,"name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.le_frameClosure","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Std/Internal/Order/FrameClosure.lean#L95-L104"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_