*frame closure** of a predicate transformer `t` with respect to a family of\nsupremum-preserving operators `op r`: the meet over all resources `r` of the `r`-upper-adjoint of `t`\nframed by `r`. It internalizes the frame rule into any `t` (see `PredTrans.frameClosure_frames`),\nwith no assumption on `t`. The exception postcondition is handed to `t` unchanged. ","docLink":"./Std/Internal/Order/FrameClosure.html#Lean.Order.PredTrans.frameClosure","kind":"def","line":34,"name":"Lean.Order.PredTrans.frameClosure","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Std/Internal/Order/FrameClosure.lean#L34-L40"}}],"imports":["Std.Internal.Order.OfProp","Std.Internal.Order.PredTrans","Std.Internal.Order.PreservesSup"],"instances":[],"name":"Std.Internal.Order.FrameClosure"}